  "prompts": {
    "point": "请分别分析下面两种电解液的温度测量。数据来自已归档Zenodo测量，保持全部10个温度点、组成及原值，不平均、不删点、不补值。不查文献，不调用子代理。明确区分测量值、拟合参数与模型估计。拟合比较Arrhenius与VTF的AICc和留一温度误差。0.1仅为本次工作条件，不是通用科学标准。这些配方可能出现在预测模型训练集中，不能称为独立留出验证。对每种配方，若AICc优选模型的loo_rmse_log10低于0.1，再用独立电导率模型对20℃作计算核对；先看到拟合结果再判断条件。没有最低电导率门槛，不需作达标排序。最后比较两种配方并说明证据边界。树间差异只描述模型分歧，不解释成已校准预测区间。\n[{\"label\": \"配方1\", \"measurements\": [{\"temperature_c\": -30.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 1.851699327963}, {\"temperature_c\": -20.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 1.840177574978}, {\"temperature_c\": -10.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 2.759636752722}, {\"temperature_c\": 0.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 3.8058648593}, {\"temperature_c\": 10.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 4.992309253987}, {\"temperature_c\": 20.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 6.156483956922}, {\"temperature_c\": 30.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 7.437532198843}, {\"temperature_c\": 40.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 8.829673135487}, {\"temperature_c\": 50.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 10.220288169566}, {\"temperature_c\": 60.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 11.603756421658}], \"prediction_request\": {\"temperature_c\": 20.0, \"candidates\": [{\"candidate_id\": \"配方1\", \"salt\": \"NaPF6\", \"solvents\": [\"EC\", \"EMC\", \"PC\"]}], \"composition_inputs\": {\"配方1\": {\"component_mmol\": {\"EC\": 0.8301158301158301, \"EMC\": 15.91085922866337, \"PC\": 6.127006827376113, \"NaPF6\": 3.8648407264066686}}}}}, {\"label\": \"配方2\", \"measurements\": [{\"temperature_c\": -30.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 1.653227261534}, {\"temperature_c\": -20.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 1.660382527732}, {\"temperature_c\": -10.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 2.6046795002}, {\"temperature_c\": 0.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 3.727320182887}, {\"temperature_c\": 10.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 5.119281608486}, {\"temperature_c\": 20.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 6.490036905405}, {\"temperature_c\": 30.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 8.011972200772}, {\"temperature_c\": 40.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 9.538101999457}, {\"temperature_c\": 50.0, \"conductivity_ms_cm\": 11.07284134